\widowctrl\hyphauto
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaTooled's configuration: shortcuts, menus, toolbars, mouse modifiers, preferences and window layout. "Set up ReaTooled" applies it after backing up your settings, and "Update ReaTooled" applies new versions while keeping your own changes.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The History tab lists what's new in each release.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaTooled's themes, installed into REAPER's ColorThemes folder. "Default_7.0 ReaTooled v3 Dark" is the default.\par}
}

