{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Applies the stored \u8220?Last Value\u8221? from the Interactive script to: 1) Selected points, 2) Razor envelope areas, 3) Time Selection. If no Last Value exists, automatically runs the Interactive script. Fader-scaled Volume lanes accept dB input (stored as raw via proper scaling).\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Set the value of many envelope points at once (priority: Selected points \u8594? Razor envelope areas \u8594? Time Selection). Values are interpreted per envelope scaling:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa60 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Fader-scaled Volume (track/take/send): enter dB (e.g., -12, 0, +3) -> internally converted to amplitude then to raw via ScaleToEnvelopeMode.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa60 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Other envelopes: written as entered (e.g., 0..1 for normalized FX params). Supports Automation Items; no SWS required.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Context-aware remove, Pro Tools style.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa60 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Razor edits present and focus on items: remove razor areas, move edit cursor to the earliest razor start, clear time selection.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa60 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Time selection and focus on items: remove the selected area (gaps included, so ripple closes the whole range). With no items selected, removes across all tracks. Moves edit cursor to selection start and clears the time selection.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa60 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab No time selection and focus on items: remove selected items and move edit cursor to the item's former start.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa60 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Otherwise: remove items/tracks/envelope points depending on focus. With the mouse over a track envelope's control panel, remove that envelope (REAPER asks for confirmation). SWS is optional; without it the envelope-panel check is skipped.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Pastes clipboard items and forces each one to fill the bounded gap on its track. Unlike the context-sensitive Special Paste, this script always fills \u8212? no Razor, no over-body, no left-fill logic. Items with no bounded gap on their track are left at their pasted position. Loop Source is enabled and a loop section is created or preserved on every pasted item.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
