{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \b \fs28 ReaTooled: The Pro Tools Alternative\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaTooled brings Pro Tools' editing features and workflow to REAPER while staying true to REAPER. Your projects stay normal REAPER projects, and ReaTooled works with any REAPER project, made with it or not.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Note:} ReaTooled changes REAPER's appearance, preferences, shortcuts, menus, toolbars and mouse behavior. Setup backs up your current settings first and asks before replacing any of your shortcuts.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Easy installation:} an illustrated installation guide and automated installer are available at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://8071910392990.gumroad.com/l/ReaTooled3"}}{\fldrslt{\ul https://8071910392990.gumroad.com/l/ReaTooled3}}}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Manual installation:} install every package in this repository, then restart REAPER and "Set up ReaTooled" starts by itself. (You can also run "Script: ReaTooled_Set up ReaTooled.lua" from the Actions list.)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Updates:} ReaTooled checks for a new version once a day and asks before updating. To update at any time, run "Script: ReaTooled_Update ReaTooled.lua".\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Going back:} run "Script: ReaTooled_Restore settings from a backup.lua" to restore your previous settings.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaTooled is a one-person project, built over 13 years of customizing REAPER for my radio and podcast work, so I can't offer individual support. If you find it useful, tips are always appreciated:\par}
